{"description":"\nThe InlineSVG component renders an accessible SVG inline in the html document.\nInlineSVG accepts the `className` prop, which you can use to style your image.\n\n> If you are rendering a square SVG icon, use [SVGIcon](SVGIcon), which provides\n> props and styles specific to icons, such as pre-defined sizes.\n\n### Setting a fixed `width` or `height`\n\nFor sizing, the component accepts `width` and `height` props, which are added\nto the SVG as attributes.\n\n```js\n---\ntype: example\n---\n<InlineSVG src={iconExample} width=\"3em\" height=\"3em\" />\n```\n\n### Sizing to fill container\n\nIf you want your SVG to expand to fill its container, set both `height`\nand `width` to `auto`.\n\n> Note that setting `inline` to `false` will cause the SVG to display block, which\n> can be useful for removing any extra space at the bottom of the image that results from\n> `line-height` being inherited.\n\n```js\n---\ntype: example\n---\n<View\n  as=\"div\"\n  width=\"15rem\"\n  borderWidth=\"small\"\n>\n  <InlineSVG\n    width=\"auto\"\n    height=\"auto\"\n    inline={false}\n    viewBox=\"0 0 500 500\"\n  >\n    <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"250\" r=\"250\" />\n  </InlineSVG>\n</View>\n```\n\n### Using SVG sprite sheets with `<use>` elements\n\nBy default, `<use>` elements are stripped for security. When rendering SVG\nsprite sheets that use `<use xlink:href=\"#id\">` references to `<symbol>` or\n`<path>` definitions, set `allowUseElement` to allow same-document fragment\nreferences. External URLs are blocked for security.\n\n```js\n---\ntype: example\n---\nconst spriteSvg = `<svg viewBox=\"0 0 120 40\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <circle id=\"dot\" cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"18\" />\n  </defs>\n  <use href=\"#dot\" x=\"0\" fill=\"#0374B5\" />\n  <use href=\"#dot\" x=\"40\" fill=\"#03893D\" />\n  <use href=\"#dot\" x=\"80\" fill=\"#E62429\" />\n</svg>`\n\nrender(\n  <div>\n    <p>\n      <code>allowUseElement</code> set: the three circles render:\n    </p>\n    <InlineSVG src={spriteSvg} width=\"9rem\" height=\"3rem\" allowUseElement />\n    <p>\n      Without <code>allowUseElement</code>: the <code>&lt;use&gt;</code>{' '}\n      elements are stripped, so nothing is drawn:\n    </p>\n    <InlineSVG src={spriteSvg} width=\"9rem\" height=\"3rem\" />\n  </div>\n)\n```\n","displayName":"InlineSVG","methods":[{"name":"handleRef","docblock":null,"modifiers":[],"params":[{"name":"el","optional":false,"type":{"name":"union","raw":"Element | null","elements":[{"name":"Element"},{"name":"null"}]}}],"returns":null},{"name":"prepareSrc","docblock":null,"modifiers":["static"],"params":[{"name":"src","optional":false,"type":{"name":"string"}}],"returns":null},{"name":"role","docblock":null,"modifiers":["get"],"params":[],"returns":null},{"name":"renderTitle","docblock":null,"modifiers":[],"params":[],"returns":null},{"name":"renderDesc","docblock":null,"modifiers":[],"params":[{"name":"desc","optional":false,"type":{"name":"intersection['description']","raw":"InlineSVGProps['description']"}}],"returns":null},{"name":"labelledBy","docblock":null,"modifiers":["get"],"params":[],"returns":null},{"name":"renderContent","docblock":null,"modifiers":[],"params":[{"name":"safeSrc","optional":false,"type":{"name":"string"}}],"returns":null},{"name":"numberToNumberType","docblock":null,"modifiers":[],"params":[{"name":"n","optional":false,"type":{"name":"union","raw":"string | number | undefined","elements":[{"name":"string"},{"name":"number"},{"name":"undefined"}]}}],"returns":null}],"props":{"children":{"required":false,"tsType":{"name":"ReactReactNode","raw":"React.ReactNode"},"description":""},"src":{"required":false,"tsType":{"name":"string"},"description":"","defaultValue":{"value":"''","computed":false}},"title":{"required":false,"tsType":{"name":"string"},"description":"","defaultValue":{"value":"''","computed":false}},"description":{"required":false,"tsType":{"name":"string"},"description":"","defaultValue":{"value":"''","computed":false}},"focusable":{"required":false,"tsType":{"name":"boolean"},"description":"","defaultValue":{"value":"false","computed":false}},"width":{"required":false,"tsType":{"name":"union","raw":"string | number","elements":[{"name":"string"},{"name":"number"}]},"description":"Width of the SVG. Accepts valid CSS unit strings like '1rem'\nTo let the SVG expand to fill its container, use \"`auto`\"","defaultValue":{"value":"'1em'","computed":false}},"height":{"required":false,"tsType":{"name":"union","raw":"string | number","elements":[{"name":"string"},{"name":"number"}]},"description":"Height of the SVG. Accepts valid CSS unit strings like '1rem'\nTo let the SVG expand to fill its container, use \"`auto`\"","defaultValue":{"value":"'1em'","computed":false}},"inline":{"required":false,"tsType":{"name":"boolean"},"description":"","defaultValue":{"value":"true","computed":false}},"color":{"required":false,"tsType":{"name":"union","raw":"| 'inherit'\n| 'primary'\n| 'secondary'\n| 'primary-inverse'\n| 'secondary-inverse'\n| 'success'\n| 'error'\n| 'alert'\n| 'warning'\n| 'brand'\n| 'auto'","elements":[{"name":"literal","value":"'inherit'"},{"name":"literal","value":"'primary'"},{"name":"literal","value":"'secondary'"},{"name":"literal","value":"'primary-inverse'"},{"name":"literal","value":"'secondary-inverse'"},{"name":"literal","value":"'success'"},{"name":"literal","value":"'error'"},{"name":"literal","value":"'alert'"},{"name":"literal","value":"'warning'"},{"name":"literal","value":"'brand'"},{"name":"literal","value":"'auto'"}]},"description":"","defaultValue":{"value":"'inherit'","computed":false}},"elementRef":{"required":false,"tsType":{"name":"signature","type":"function","raw":"(element: Element | null) => void","signature":{"arguments":[{"type":{"name":"union","raw":"Element | null","elements":[{"name":"Element"},{"name":"null"}]},"name":"element"}],"return":{"name":"void"}}},"description":"provides a reference to the underlying html root element"},